 \par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
\~\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
\~\~\~'In my youth,' Father William replied to his son,\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
\~\~\~\~'I feared it might injure the brain;\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
\~\~\~But, now that I'm perfectly sure I have none,\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
\~\~\~\~Why, I do it again and again.'\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
\~\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
\~\~\~'You are old,' said the youth, 'as I mentioned before,\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
\~\~\~\~And have grown most uncommonly fat;\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
\~\~\~Yet you turned a back-somersault in at the door--\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
\~\~\~\~Pray, what is the reason of that?'\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
\~\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
\~\~\~'In my youth,' said the sage, as he shook his grey locks,\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
\~\~\~\~'I kept all my limbs very supple\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
\~\~\~By the use of this ointment--one shilling the box--\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
\~\~\~\~Allow me to sell you a couple?'\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
\~\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
\~\~\~'You are old,' said the youth, 'and your jaws are too weak\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
\~\~\~\~For anything tougher than suet;\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
\~\~\~Yet you finished the goose, with the bones and the beak--\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
\~\~\~\~Pray how did you manage to do it?'\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
\~\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
\~\~\~'In my youth,' said his father, 'I took to the law,\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
\~\~\~\~And argued each case with my wife;\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
\~\~\~And the muscular strength, which it gave to my jaw,\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
\~\~\~\~Has lasted the rest of my life.'\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
\~\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
\~\~\~'You are old,' said the youth, 'one would hardly suppose\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
\~\~\~\~That your eye was as steady as ever;\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
\~\~\~Yet you balanced an eel on the end of your nose--\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
\~\~\~\~What made you so awfully clever?'\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
\~\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
