{\b
Alice's Evidence\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
\~\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
'Here!' cried Alice, quite forgetting in the flurry of the moment how large she had grown in the last few minutes, and she jumped up in such a hurry that she tipped over the jury-box with the edge of her skirt, upsetting all the jurymen on to the heads of the crowd below, and there they lay sprawling about, reminding her very much of a globe of goldfish she had accidentally upset the week before.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
